import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 844 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Civilizational Applications of Isolation-Space Technology","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 844 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Civilizational Applications of Isolation-Space Technology","no":844,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Isolation Space","Safe Experiment","Law Barrier","Civilizational Security"],"related":["64-Isolation-Space Construction Technology","86-Isolation-Space Low-Pollution Procedure","63-Replication-Mirror Technical Principle","765-New-Cosmos Frontier and Colonialism Critique"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0844_模块4-超脱者与科技-隔离空间文明应用.md","filePath":"en/0844_模块4-超脱者与科技-隔离空间文明应用.md"}'),o={name:"en/0844_模块4-超脱者与科技-隔离空间文明应用.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,h){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-844-transcended-ones-and-technology-civilizational-applications-of-isolation-space-technology" tabindex="-1">Entry 844 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Civilizational Applications of Isolation-Space Technology <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-844-transcended-ones-and-technology-civilizational-applications-of-isolation-space-technology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 844 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Civilizational Applications of Isolation-Space Technology&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 64, 86, 63, 765</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-most-dangerous-experiments-must-be-done-in-a-cage" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the most dangerous experiments must be done in a &quot;cage&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-most-dangerous-experiments-must-be-done-in-a-cage" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the most dangerous experiments must be done in a &quot;cage&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Once any civilization is strong enough to operate laws, it holds dynamite sufficient to destroy itself. The old worldview never faces this squarely — the protagonist casually emits power and shatters half a continent, yet no one ever asks &quot;what if the experiment explodes?&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is: <strong>outside the main plane, build a law-isolated &quot;cage.&quot;</strong> This is isolation space. This entry explains: how the transcended one uses isolation-space technology to cage the whole civilization&#39;s adventure, experiment, and exploration safely.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally embody <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> and <strong>the law-first axiom</strong>: high-risk operations must proceed within controlled space; isolation degree is a law-level parameter; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires dangerous experiments not harm innocent Myriad Ranks; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires safety be protection for all beings; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires adventure&#39;s purpose still be common uplift.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-what-isolation-space-is-three-isolations" tabindex="-1">I. What Isolation Space Is: Three Isolations <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-what-isolation-space-is-three-isolations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. What Isolation Space Is: Three Isolations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Document 64 defines it clearly: isolation space is an independent space instance outside the main plane, with high law-isolation degree. It achieves &quot;three isolations&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Law isolation</strong>: laws operating inside do not permeate the main plane; main-plane law changes do not interfere inside;</li><li><strong>Matter isolation</strong>: no natural matter-exchange channel; all entry/exit goes through controlled interfaces;</li><li><strong>Consciousness isolation</strong>: internal consciousness activity is not directly perceived by the main plane&#39;s consciousness domain, preventing consciousness pollution.</li></ul><p>Standard isolation space uses seven law barriers (matter block, energy attenuation, law filter, consciousness shield, time buffer, spatial lock, anchor fixation), achieving 99.97%+ comprehensive isolation degree. <strong>Its essence is installing a leak-proof valve on civilization&#39;s curiosity.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-civilizational-applications-isolation-space-is-not-only-a-laboratory" tabindex="-1">II. Civilizational Applications: Isolation Space Is Not Only a Laboratory <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-civilizational-applications-isolation-space-is-not-only-a-laboratory" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Civilizational Applications: Isolation Space Is Not Only a Laboratory&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Isolation space&#39;s applications in hyper-multiverse civilization far exceed &quot;doing experiments&quot;:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Application Scenario</th><th>How Used</th><th>Whom Protected</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>High-risk law experiments</td><td>Test new laws in B-grade+ isolation space; even if it explodes, does not pollute the main plane</td><td>Main-plane Myriad Ranks</td></tr><tr><td>Replication-Mirror mirror reconstruction</td><td>Replicas are rebuilt in A-grade isolation space; research does not affect the original</td><td>The alien land under study</td></tr><tr><td>Strange-energy containment</td><td>Dangerous energy contained in isolation space, does not leak out</td><td>Everything around</td></tr><tr><td>New-civilization rehearsal</td><td>Simulate a new institution / new law in isolation space, then promote after validation</td><td>Real civilization</td></tr><tr><td>Cultivation buffer</td><td>C-grade chamber-level as personal cultivation room; going off-track does not harm others</td><td>Cultivator and neighbors</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="iii-time-flow-rate-civilization-s-safe-accelerator" tabindex="-1">III. Time-Flow Rate: Civilization&#39;s &quot;Safe Accelerator&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-time-flow-rate-civilization-s-safe-accelerator" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Time-Flow Rate: Civilization&#39;s &quot;Safe Accelerator&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>One undervalued capability of isolation space is <strong>adjustable time-flow rate</strong> (1:100 to 100:1). This lets the transcended one do what the old world could not:</p><ul><li>An experiment requiring a century to validate runs a millennium in isolation space; only a decade passes in the main plane;</li><li>A new institution&#39;s &quot;trial run&quot; walks through several generations in isolation space; the main plane is unscathed;</li><li>Dangerous reactions may be &quot;slowed down,&quot; leaving time to handle.</li></ul><p>Time-flow rate stacked with isolation degree, isolation space becomes civilization&#39;s &quot;safe sandbox&quot; — <strong>trial freely; trial-and-error cost goes to zero.</strong> This is entry 765&#39;s technical confidence opposing &quot;crude colonial-style frontier&quot;: want to open a new cosmos? First simulate it running ten thousand years in isolation space.</p><h2 id="iv-safe-destruction-the-cage-must-also-be-dismantlable" tabindex="-1">IV. Safe Destruction: The Cage Must Also Be Dismantlable <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-safe-destruction-the-cage-must-also-be-dismantlable" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Safe Destruction: The Cage Must Also Be Dismantlable&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Isolation space is not a permanent building; it has a retirement process. Technology ethics requires:</p><ul><li>After experiments complete, replicas are safely destroyed per standard process, leaving no residue;</li><li>At retirement, first dispose of internal contents, then lift barriers layer by layer, finally reclaim the space anchor;</li><li>After destruction, run residue scan, confirming no space debris leaked back to the main plane.</li></ul><p>&quot;Buildable&quot; also must be &quot;dismantleable clean&quot; — otherwise isolation space itself becomes a new pollution source.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: freely trial-and-error in isolation space, downgrading &quot;one failure destroys civilization&quot; high risk to bearable experiment cost</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: dangerous experiments caged, do not harm innocent Myriad Ranks, do not use others as experiment cost</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style strong ones casually emit power shattering continents, never considering experiment safety; Heng Yuan Zhou uses isolation space to cage all high-risk</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: isolation space protects all beings in the main plane; personal cultivation buffer rooms also open to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: isolation-space principle, seven barriers, time-flow rate, and destruction process all public</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-the-cage-s-operation-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: The Cage&#39;s Operation and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-the-cage-s-operation-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: The Cage&#39;s Operation and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Isolation space is not &quot;build then leave alone&quot;; its operation itself is the transcended one&#39;s post. Every isolation space&#39;s isolation degree, time-flow rate, destruction records are real-time monitored under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision; any barrier-leak sign immediately alerts. The transcended one operating isolation space and caging dangerous experiments is counted into civilizational weight by the civilizational risk avoided — the steadier the protection, the higher the weight. This set of mechanisms lets the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm dare to think and dare to try, yet always trial in a safe sandbox. The cage is not a chain restraining curiosity, but a runway letting curiosity run wildly without worry.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Isolation-space technology is a powerful civilization&#39;s &quot;safety redundancy.&quot; It tells Myriad Ranks: true transcendence is not &quot;strong enough to do whatever one wants,&quot; but &quot;strong enough to know how to cage danger.&quot; When the transcended one&#39;s every high-risk operation proceeds in isolation space, every trial-and-error does not harm the innocent, every abandoned space is dismantled clean, civilization grips the balance of power and restraint. This is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s final landing in physical space.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/64-隔离空间构建技术.html">Entry 64 · Isolation-Space Construction Technology</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/86-隔离空间低污染流程.html">Entry 86 · Isolation-Space Low-Pollution Procedure</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/63-复制镜技术原理.html">Entry 63 · Replication-Mirror Technical Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/765_模块4-超多元级文明工程-新宇宙开拓与殖民批判.html">Entry 765 · New-Cosmos Frontier and Colonialism Critique</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
